# Kit files are hashed in MANIFEST.sha256; line endings must be identical on
# every platform or the checksums disagree. Text files are LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Verbatim from the plugin install, CRLF included: the plugin-fix proof checks that the
# rewrite keeps every byte but the two commands, so the endings are the evidence.
tools/impact-fixtures/ua-hooks.json -text
